    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The Waning of Mystacor</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Mystacor was failing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;No, Micah supposed that was too harsh a word for it. Not failing but fading in a way. Concerning and disheartening but inevitable in this day and age. After all, there was a blood illness spreading now and that was enough for the whole world to hold its breath in terror.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
